Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: spacemit-firmware
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         edk2-spacemit,
         spacemit-ec-firmware,
         opensbi-spacemit,
         u-boot-spl-spacemit,
         esos-spacemit
Description: Metapackage for SpacemiT platform firmware
 This metapackage depends on the SpacemiT platform firmware and boot
 related packages: EDK2, EC firmware, OpenSBI, the U-Boot SPL and ESOS.
 .
 It installs no files of its own; it exists only to pull in the
 SpacemiT firmware/boot packages in one step, without the GPU userspace
 driver (img-gpu-powervr) or the linux-firmware-spacemit blobs.
